                <note rend="inline" type="source">823.51/191: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gonzales</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-09-23T14:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 23,
                                1921—2 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 5:15 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>71. Your 48, September 22, 6 p.m. Cable instructions to Peruvian Ambassador to
                    sign contract going forward tomorrow.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gonzales</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
